{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/58813fcf90fc4683a7ef2dfa32504fa9/snapshots/4bae7edbc80c4e60a1125be1c5e3a0b9-00005.jpg\"/><p>秋季來臨，新疆維吾爾自治區塔合曼濕地展現迷人秋色，壯麗山巒、金黃牧場、平靜水域，為當地秋景增添光彩。遠處山巒覆蓋白雪，附近牧場泛着金黃與褐色，氂牛悠閒漫步濕地，流露蓬勃生機。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"8503195_新疆塔合曼 秋色濕地醉人 - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/58813fcf90fc4683a7ef2dfa32504fa9/snapshots/4bae7edbc80c4e60a1125be1c5e3a0b9-00006.jpg\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>塔合曼濕地位於慕士塔格峰腳下，海拔3,050米，屬塔什庫爾干塔吉克自治縣的高原濕地。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T01:23:58.150398+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T01:18:23.660621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T01:18:23.660621+00:00","content_hash":"ce4f27e59d72a1e8d6b5deba99848485b4ffc494d8c9b98e95c2257ead7ee6f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}